X.B force field
Xworks when battling
X.B Morgoth.
X.TP 1.5i
X.B Troll
Xmay regenerate its
X.B energy
Xand
X.B strength
Xwhile in battle.
X.TP 1.5i
X.B Wraith
Xmay make a player blind.
X.sh "Treasures"
XVarious treasure types are as follows:
